Arriving by Car
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Leave the airport following the "Madrid downtown" (Madrid Centro) signals. Then
take the M-40 motorway following the A-6 directions, which lead you to the N-VI
motorway (on its way to A Corun~a). Once in this motorway, take exit 18 to "Las
Rozas and El Escorial".  To arrive to Euroforum from El Escorial, just follow
either "Monasterio" or "Euroforum Infantes" signals.

Parking at Euroforum Infantes costs about 300 or 400 pts, although you can find
free park at El Escorial downtown (but pay attention to the blue marks on the
floor! It means you have to pay depending on how long your car is there, buying
a ticket in a special machine in the street).

